{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_2000_situation", "source_sha256": "65322ab5875879d251ab9b18ec70ca0760478b62e6a228a8a2b9735d2af0d722", "ja": "トーク番組の収録前", "zh": "谈话节目录影前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_2000_place", "source_sha256": "2e32c611423df90ffdcd37956af5b67b223b0440bfed3735e47647a664060358", "ja": "TVスタジオ", "zh": "电视台摄影棚", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_2001_037nao", "source_sha256": "57b7071462294fd6d0046b640c71292a86acf98e184e381aa010a6a89a0b6dc5", "ja": "ん～、難しいなぁ。どないすればええんやろ？\n……あっ、{$P$}さん！", "zh": "嗯～好难啊，该怎么办才好呢？\n……啊，{$P$}先生！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_2002_p", "source_sha256": "21a5151dfbb4bf00da43e292699fe98f30c5cae8d6f92f286df688e680b5a202", "ja": "奈緒、どうかしたのか？\nもうすぐ本番だけど……。", "zh": "奈绪，怎么了吗？\n正式拍摄就快要开始了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_2003_037nao", "source_sha256": "de91f83b7ad40eea4a91d180b784c30875ed2bd407340aa9684fa07fa9c1e919", "ja": "いや、今日の番組、どういうトークスタイルで\nいこうかなーって悩んでて。", "zh": "没什么，我在烦恼今天的节目上\n要用哪种谈话风格才好啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_2004_p", "source_sha256": "27303975ee9e19e238f35f6f2e1185785af83996e8c93d569128e62bc5dde20c", "ja": "ト、トークスタイルとは……？", "zh": "谈、谈话风格是指……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_2005_037nao", "source_sha256": "d1dcbcd85aa6e02e92c412d253c646b6320b1a45158dcbbc850116c286df7b63", "ja": "私、普通にしてると、普通に関西弁が出るんです。\nでもアイドルやし、やっぱ東京弁やんな！って……。", "zh": "我用一般的语气讲话，就会自然说出关西腔。\n但身为偶像，感觉还是要用东京腔呀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_2006_p", "source_sha256": "f73b55b19ac209e74951ee4e18b9934c9fbb821a86ac2ab7f90efe1621c54c19", "ja": "ああ、そういうことか。いつも通りに話して\nいいと思うけどな。それが奈緒の個性なんだし。", "zh": "喔喔，是这样啊，我是觉得\n和平常一样讲话就好了啊，那也是奈绪的特色嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_2007_037nao", "source_sha256": "49d5ac37abf7dd564bbd2f822a43241dc9a9b77dd08e16da5b4570d0e0d6a2f0", "ja": "いつもの私ですか？　うん……せやな、そうします！\n{$P$}さん、ありがとうな！", "zh": "平常的我吗？嗯……也对，就这样吧！\n{$P$}先生，谢谢你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
